---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { email } from "../../data.js";
---

<Base
  title="Melaka 1511"
  lines={["Melaka 1511"]}
  dek="A turn-based strategy game set in the Melaka Sultanate. Voxel art, PC first."
  description="Melaka 1511 is a turn-based strategy game set in the Melaka Sultanate, in the years before the Portuguese arrive in 1511."
  image="/img/melaka-1511.jpg"
>
  <section class="sys read">
    <div class="row">
      <dl class="facts" data-rise>
        <div><dt>Genre</dt><dd>Turn-based strategy</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Platform</dt><dd>PC first</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Status</dt><dd>In development, the prototype runs</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div class="body">
        <figure data-rise><img src="/img/melaka-1511.jpg" alt="Melaka 1511, early build: a voxel harbour town" width="720" height="405" /></figure>
        <p data-rise>You start weak after the fall of Temasek, and you have until the Portuguese arrive in 1511 to unite the peninsula.</p>
        <p data-rise>You use officers like Tun Perak and Hang Tuah to build the economy, raise an army and win over the states around you. You trade, govern, defend and negotiate. 1511 changed trade across the whole region, and almost no game has touched it.</p>
        <p data-rise><a href="https://youtu.be/4TbsJau7QmA" data-embed="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/4TbsJau7QmA?autoplay=1&rel=0">Watch the video</a>.</p>
        <h2 data-rise>Publishers</h2>
        <p data-rise>We're talking to publishers now. If you'd like the deck and a build, <a href={`mailto:${email}?subject=Melaka%201511`}>email us</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
